# Unicode CLDR 47, locale hi, gregorian wide and abbreviated month names
# (cldr-json 47.0.0, cldr-dates-full/main/hi/ca-gregorian.json).
# फ़रवरी is written with the nukta (फ + U+093C); the nukta-less
# spelling फरवरी is as common in ordinary Hindi typing, and names the
# same month, so both ship.
फ़रवरी
फरवरी
फ़र
फर
